{
  "title": "Warm Yeasty Ethiopian Lentils Misir Wot",
  "description": "A traditional Ethiopian dish made with red lentils, onions, garlic, and a blend of spices, featuring a yeasty flavor from beer and a velvety texture, all in a cast-iron skillet.",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
